  "prose|prop:text|MCP server \"{}\" has a literal secret, so Codex agents don't get it. Use an environment variable reference such as ${TOKEN}.": 1,
  "prose|prop:text|MCP server \"{}\": env {} takes its value from another variable, which Codex can't pass on. Name the variable {} itself.": 1,
